        "width": 1500,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Half-Built — 3 gaps\n\n1. **Score Draft → prompt** is blank. Write a NARROW prompt that returns ONE NUMBER between 1 and 10. Score the draft against the brief on clarity, tone, length, completeness. Reference the brief via `$('Set Input').item.json.task` and the draft via `$json.text` (the draft is the previous-node output). No explanation, no punctuation — just the number.\n\n2. **Score >= 8? → rightValue** is set to `0` (always passes). Change it to the threshold from the node's name (8). The expression on the left already converts the score text to a number with `Number($json.text.trim())`.\n\n3. **Revise → prompt** is blank. Write a prompt that takes the original draft AND the feedback and produces a revised version. Reference:\n   - the brief: `{{ $('Set Input').item.json.task }}`\n   - the original draft: `{{ $('Generate Draft').item.json.text }}`\n   - the feedback: `{{ $('Critique').item.json.text }}`\n   Output the revised document only — no preamble.\n\n**Rule:** no Code node. The pattern is *Evaluator / Optimiser*. One retry only — no infinite loop.\n"
      }
    }
